# A fat two-voice bass for Acid Tracker: a saw and a detuned pulse,
# filtered, with the pulse width sweeping while the note holds.
instrument fatbass
  wave saw
  v2 wave pulse; v2 duty 30; v2 fine +6
  both adsr 2 120 60 80
  filter lp 60 res 6
  both route on
  both gate on
  loop
    v2 duty +2
    wait 1
  end
on release
  both gate off
end
